WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,830 --> 00:00:02,730
Brother Xiao

2
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:06,270
I'm afraid that Li Mo and the others may not have any bones left after being chewed, nonsense.

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:07,630
Stupid is not flattering

4
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:08,750
Now I don't even have my life anymore

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,710
See how he still remembers it

6
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,710
In the secret realm, brains are more important than strength

7
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:16,870
A brainless fool like Li Mo, Brother Xiao, look what that is

8
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:24,680
Is he crazy for daring to beat a strong officer and run around at night?

9
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:32,300
He came from us and burned me with firewood. Li Mo

10
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:36,400
He actually didn’t kill Li Mo

11
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,640
You are so ruthless

12
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,680
Give him his own way and treat him in his own way

13
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,480
I'm just giving you the gift

14
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,400
Return it as it is

15
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:43,960
I underestimated you

16
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,000
How about making a deal

17
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,000
Hand over all the harvest of the past few days

18
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,290
I lured away Shougun and spared your lives. You dream?

19
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:52,100
Who do you think you are negotiating terms with?

20
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,540
The fire is burning your savings and they won't last until dawn

21
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:58,780
Do you want to hand over money to protect your life or bury your life and money here without any money? You choose the boss and agree to him.

22
00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:00,220
How can those things be important?

23
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,980
How do I know you won't take anything?

24
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:03,060
Then lead the longevity group to kill us

25
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:04,260
I swear to God

26
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:05,960
Bullshit vision

27
00:01:06,730 --> 00:01:08,010
Do you think I will believe your lies?

28
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:10,380
Since this deal can't be done

29
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:12,420
Then there's no need to talk nonsense anymore
